\section{Conclusions}
The STME-RS-A framework provides a falsifiable extension of RS geometry, predicting 
non-equidistant KK resonances accessible at the HL-LHC. The propulsion stress test 
demonstrates stable operation under extreme thermal and pressure loads, validating 
the simulation architecture and solver stack.

